      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "dikoro le dibatha tše masomepedi sekete",
      "rationale": "Dikelo tše nne tše di lekanago — koro, boroto, beberi, mafura — ka palo ya go swana."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "ye e kgodilwego",
      "rationale": "מכות e hlaka ke 'magodi' (a mokgwa wa go kgoba koro); 'ye e kgodilwego' ke tlhalošo ya sebopego se."
    },
    {
      "kind": "elision",
      "subject": "dikoro",
      "rationale": "כרים e hwetšwa fela ga-bjale mabapi le koro ya mathomo; go bolelwa gape ka mehla ga diphetolelo."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme bona, go bakgobokgobo, bagodi ba mehlare, ke file koro ye e kgodilwego go bahlanka ba gago: dikoro tše masomepedi sekete, le boroto, dikoro tše masomepedi sekete, le beberi, dibatha tše masomepedi sekete, le mafura, dibatha tše masomepedi sekete.",
